{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_75_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_75","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春王三月庚午，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_75_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_75","textTraditional":"二、夏，楚人滅黃。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_75_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_75","textTraditional":"三、秋七月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_75_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_75","textTraditional":"四、冬十有二月丁丑，陳侯處臼卒。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}